From e0602ab08b2b56ecb324f860fd6ee4681982b87d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Niklas Klein <niklas.klein@erynoa.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 13:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ragfit: OIDC login only for listed teams (0003
 oidc-login-gate)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Rejects OIDC logins without an allowed team (fail closed) and password login for OIDC-linked users.
See CHANGES-RAGFIT.md. GPLv3 §10.
